I get the impression there are tons of red tiles around here, so I'd guess it's either this side or that side.

651
00:52:00,427 --> 00:52:01,077
うん。
Yeah.

652
00:52:01,477 --> 00:52:02,477
なんとなくね。
Just a hunch.

653
00:52:02,927 --> 00:52:03,477
うん。
Yeah.

654
