And, let's see... it says Ryudai students. Futenma Driving...

1442
01:53:46,060 --> 01:53:48,310
結構…沖縄市？
Pretty... Okinawa City?

1443
01:53:49,460 --> 01:53:51,360
沖縄市だからこっち側かな？
Since it's Okinawa City, maybe over on this side?

1444
01:53:51,660 --> 01:53:53,010
うん、こっち側っぽいな。
Yeah, looks like this side.

1445
01:53:53,110 --> 01:53:59,660
なんか沖縄が来た時に割と那覇に置きたくなる…那覇か沖縄市のどちらかに置きたくなるんじゃが…
Whenever Okinawa comes up I tend to want to pin Naha... either Naha or Okinawa City, but...

1446
01:53:59,960 --> 01:54:04,760
なんかこれを見てる感じだと、意外とこっち側、ここの辺だな。
Looking at all this, it's actually over on this side, right around here.

1447
01:54:05,060 --> 01:54:05,610
うん。
Yeah.

1448
01:54:05,810 --> 01:54:09,860
これは時間かけたら5kいけそうな問題。
This looks like a 5K-able round if I take my time.

1449
