It's so hard to tell sometimes.

1478
01:55:43,765 --> 01:55:45,465
なんか川かなって思っちゃう。
I always end up thinking it might be a river.

1479
01:55:45,515 --> 01:55:47,815
あ、本当に川じゃなかった。
Oh, it really wasn't a river.

1480
01:55:48,165 --> 01:55:49,765
