よいしょ。
Alright.

1526
01:57:57,565 --> 01:58:00,615
宮城県岩沼市。岩沼市っぽい！
Iwanuma City, Miyagi Prefecture. Totally looks like Iwanuma!

1527
01:58:01,115 --> 01:58:03,115
仙台ではないっぽいのじゃ。
Looks like it's not Sendai after all.

1528
01:58:04,565 --> 01:58:05,315
うん。
Yeah.

1529
01:58:07,165 --> 01:58:11,315
